  "url": "shaders/gravitational-lensing.wgsl",
  "description": "Schwarzschild geodesic raytracing with a Shakura-Sunyaev accretion disk: temperature follows T(r) ~ r^-3/4 through a Planck blackbody fit, and Keplerian orbital velocity v ~ r^-1/2 drives relativistic Doppler beaming (delta^3) so the approaching limb brightens correctly. Each of the eight FFT bins owns a disk annulus. Fixes a bug where zoom_config.x (time, not audio) was read as an audio level, making the camera orbit accelerate quadratically forever.",
